WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.700
Meet SalesFriend,

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.000
the simple, fast way to manage

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.350
your dealership stock and reservations.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:08.850
Adding a vehicle is easy.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.450
Take two photos:

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:11.900
one of the number plate,

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:13.520
and one of the price sheet.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.450
AI fills in the vehicle details for you,

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.100
saving your team valuable time.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.980
Quickly find the vehicle
you're looking for,

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.820
check its colour-coded status,

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:25.300
view the details,

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.920
and reserve it in just a few steps.

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:30.220
See who made each reservation

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.260
and how much time is left
before it expires.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:36.900
Your whole team has access
to the same information

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.440
and can track the history of changes.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:41.560
Everything stays organised,

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.680
so every salesperson can focus

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:45.400
on what they do best:

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:46.400
selling.

00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.100
SalesFriend.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.060
Less time entering data.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:51.380
More time selling.
